ssex, between 23 and 24 February 2012. The tour began with the Earl and Countess arriving, aboard RFA \"Fort Rosalie\", at the Deep Water Harbour of Bridgetown, where Barbadian military personnel were given inspection. To","terminal_format_issue":"Format Agent is not selected as the Output Agent","topology_statistics":{"agent_count":0,"component_count":0,"directed_edge_count":0,"fan_in_agent_ids":[],"fan_out_agent_ids":[],"max_depth":0,"max_width":0,"output_agent_id":null,"quotient_directed_edge_count":0,"reciprocal_pair_count":0,"relation_count":0,"root_agent_ids":[],"root_component_count":0,"sink_agent_ids":[],"sink_component_count":0,"structural_depth":0,"topology_family":"empty","topology_motifs":[]}}","role":"user"}],"schema_version":"flowsteer.director.transcript.v1"}

