h ballets as \"Serenade\", \"Agon\" and \"Dances at a Gathering\". She retired in 1981, becoming a ballet teacher, and in 1997 published an autobiography, \"Once a Dancer\". In 2012, Kent published her first book for children, \"Ballerina","terminal_format_issue":"Format Agent is not selected as the Output Agent","topology_statistics":{"agent_count":0,"component_count":0,"directed_edge_count":0,"fan_in_agent_ids":[],"fan_out_agent_ids":[],"max_depth":0,"max_width":0,"output_agent_id":null,"quotient_directed_edge_count":0,"reciprocal_pair_count":0,"relation_count":0,"root_agent_ids":[],"root_component_count":0,"sink_agent_ids":[],"sink_component_count":0,"structural_depth":0,"topology_family":"empty","topology_motifs":[]}}","role":"user"}],"schema_version":"flowsteer.director.transcript.v1"}

